---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shutter Scotland | Terms of Service">
	<main style="background-color: #FAFAFA; min-height: 80vh; padding: 64px 48px; box-sizing: border-box;">
		<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
			<span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #0A0A0A; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 2px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">LEGAL_01 // SYSTEM TERMS</span>
			
			<h1 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: #0A0A0A; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
				TERMS & <br><span style="color: #FF4500;">CONDITIONS.</span>
			</h1>

			<div style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #0A0A0A; line-height: 1.6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;">
				
				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">01 // CANCELLATIONS & REFUNDS</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">Tours can be fully refunded or rescheduled up to 24 hours before your scheduled launch time. Cancellations made within 24 hours of the walk are strictly non-refundable, as operational slots are limited to maximize individual training.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">02 // WEATHER OPERATIONAL DIRECTIVE</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">We shoot rain or shine. Heavy skies and wet stones provide optimal high-contrast street reflections. In the event of extreme weather warnings that present a direct safety hazard, Shutter Scotland will cancel the deployment and issue a 100% refund or alternative date option.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">03 // HARDWARE & PERSONAL LIABILITY</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">Participants are entirely responsible for their own physical safety and camera hardware during the tour. Shutter Scotland is not liable for accidental drops, slips on historic paths, steps, or liquid damage to electronic equipment.</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</MainLayout>